# Preserve every audited snapshot byte across Git add and checkout operations.
* -text

# Hash-verified evidence artifacts: store and check out exact bytes.
# The archived Week 6 exploration pipelines record SHA-256 hashes of their
# files (Freeze_Manifest, Legacy_Manifest, Run_Metadata, Analysis);
# line-ending conversion on checkout would break hash verification on a
# fresh clone. The fresh week-06 records results hashes in its run metadata,
# so it gets the same byte-exact treatment.
week-06-explorations/** -text
week-06/** -text
# Week 7 evidence and executed artifacts are hash-verified byte-for-byte.
week-07/** -text
# Generated-in-place table file: the generator writes LF explicitly, so pin
# checkout to LF everywhere to keep regeneration byte-identical on Windows.
week-09/W09_Paper_Tables.md eol=lf
